    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chimera is a<i>\u00a0roguelike bullet hell where your DNA is your build</i>. You control a genetically unstable hybrid chimera, assembling abilities like Tetris blocks in a <i>hexagonal gene pool</i> to create devastating synergies. Dodge bullets, outmaneuver enemies, and mutate your way to victory in this fast-paced roguelike where every run is a fresh experiment in chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Genetic Tetris System</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bullet Hell Combat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roguelike Progression</p></li></ul>",
